    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 7.079,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "春风拂暖，万物苏。这几天啊，平乐县杨安乡的石面山村有两千亩的李子花呢，",
      "score": 0.1534,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0682,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0641,
        "sc_delta": 0.0042,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.046,
        "seg_cer": 0.065,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.5,
        "phon_examples": "石/四",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "春风拂暖，万物苏。这几天啊，平乐县杨安乡的四面山村有两千亩的李子发呢。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 7.079,
      "end": 12.688,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "就被春风悄悄的唤醒了。漫山遍野李花呢是开起特别的漂亮，",
      "score": 0.2366,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1644,
        "sc_logprob": -0.1807,
        "sc_delta": -0.0162,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.244,
        "seg_cer": 0.24,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "就被春风悄悄地唤醒了。满山遍野理发呢，是看起来特别的漂亮。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 12.688,
      "end": 17.014,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "就成为了一个花的海洋。好多人呢都去那个赏花，",
      "score": 0.2654,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.2085,
        "sc_logprob": -0.2551,
        "sc_delta": -0.0466,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.335,
        "seg_cer": 0.2,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "就成为那个画的海洋，好多人呢都去那个赏画。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 17.014,
      "end": 20.944,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "去那个赏春，甚至呢也就推动了乡村旅游，",
      "score": 0.7914,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -1.139,
        "sc_logprob": -1.0417,
        "sc_delta": 0.0972,
        "acoustic_dev": 1.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.471,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.286,
        "phon_examples": "春/村 赏/桑",
        "lexicon": "咧",
        "text_free": "克克桑村，总之咧，也就推动了乡村旅游。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 20.944,
      "end": 24.925,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "实现了一个开门红。在和煦的春光里面，",
      "score": 0.3636,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.3322,
        "sc_logprob": -0.3246,
        "sc_delta": 0.0077,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.589,
        "seg_cer": 0.125,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "实现了一个开门红，在何训的春光里面。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 24.925,
      "end": 29.028,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "一个个淡雅洁白的李子花的花蕾呢是含苞待放，",
      "score": 0.2352,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1002,
        "sc_logprob": -0.1046,
        "sc_delta": -0.0044,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.112,
        "seg_cer": 0.3,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "嘞",
        "text_free": "一个个丹牙洁白的李子，画的画累嘞，是含苞待放。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 29.316,
      "end": 32.855,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "在初春的石面山村装扮的生机盎然。",
      "score": 0.78,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.5555,
        "sc_logprob": -0.5329,
        "sc_delta": 0.0227,
        "acoustic_dev": 1.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.4,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.5,
        "phon_examples": "山/三 石/四 春/存",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "在储存的四面三层，装扮得生机盎然。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 33.392,
      "end": 36.119,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "微风吹来啊，花枝随风而动，",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.035,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0308,
        "sc_delta": 0.0042,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "微风吹来啊，花枝随风而动。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 36.119,
      "end": 40.047,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "飘落了阵阵的花雨。我是一名摄影爱好者，",
      "score": 0.0538,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.014,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0224,
        "sc_delta": -0.0084,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.118,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "飘落了阵阵的话语。我是一名摄影爱好者。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 40.047,
      "end": 43.289,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "这几天听我们朋友说杨安乡李花开得不错，",
      "score": 0.6216,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.9401,
        "sc_logprob": -0.8847,
        "sc_delta": 0.0555,
        "acoustic_dev": 1.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.222,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "这几天听闻朋友说，阳安乡里花开得不错。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 43.32,
      "end": 47.97,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "想拍些素材。到这一看，漫山遍野的李花相当的美丽。",
      "score": 0.0435,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0033,
        "sc_logprob": -0.004,
        "sc_delta": -0.0007,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.095,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "想拍些素材，到这里看漫山遍野的礼花，相当的美丽。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 47.97,
      "end": 52.211,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "这里太漂亮了，远看那个李花白茫茫的一片，",
      "score": 0.0254,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0012,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0012,
        "sc_delta": 0.0,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.056,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "这里太漂亮了，远看那个梨花白茫茫的一片。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 52.211,
      "end": 54.707,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "我朋友们每年都喜欢来这里拍照。",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0006,
